Subject: [PATCH] Phase 1: Pure Network Boot of Drive :0 over DriveWire 3/4 (OP_READEX 0xD2)

Phase 1 Deliverables:
- Eliminate embedded 425 KB RAM disk, yielding lean 66,048-byte TRSDOS.bin
- Implement DriveWire OP_READEX (0xD2) sector read with 16-bit big-endian checksum in driver-FDCDVR.S
- Implement dw_offset table supporting DiskDISK (+1 sector offset) and JV1 (+0 offset) images
- Enforce Stage 1 read-only write protection (R_PROTECTED / Error 15) in DOWRIT
- Replace in-memory slice scanning in ipl-BIOS.s with direct DriveWire network boot of Drive :0
- Route ipl-DOS.S auto-boot directly into default TRSDOS IPL (TRSDOS Ready prompt)

